      "\n"
      "The section's heading is 'Line' for both kinds it serves. It is NOT\n"
      "renamed to 'Callout' for annotations: the section is named for the\n"
      "schema message it edits, which is the rule that lets one component\n"
      "serve both, and a heading that changes with the selection makes the\n"
      "panel look like it has more sections than it does.\n"
      "\n"
      "Each onCommit calls commitLine and hands the result to\n"
      "state.applyStyleEdit, dropping an undefined edit.\n"
      "\n"
      "SOLID: read lineModel inside a memo or accessor, never in the\n"
      "component body."
